  "concrete_source_cause": "SpaceshipTrailP1 Init calls makeSpaceshipTrail, which builds each vertex color with HSVA. Native fallback 02 Colors.lua defines HSVA through HSVToColor; the owned host does not define it. Both shared and separate preparation stop before retaining a scene because that global is nil.",
  "native_conversion_requirements": "Hue is divided by 60 directly; the fallback branches on the floored sector and does not normalize hue or clamp saturation/value. Alpha is preserved when present; HSVToColor otherwise uses zero. Keep these native Lua semantics.",
  "control_requirement": "A real ActorMultiVertex Init must call the native-compatible HSVA helper and validate its resulting colors before a full repair.",
